# =====================================================================
# Trivy exceptions. Each entry: why it cannot be fixed on our side,
# why the risk is acceptable, and an expiry date to force a review.
# =====================================================================

# --- nginx:stable-alpine (official image, latest digest already used) ---
# libxslt is fixed in Alpine (1.1.43-r4) but the official nginx image
# has not been rebuilt yet. The XSLT module is not loaded in our config,
# so the vulnerable library is never used. Short expiry: upstream rebuild expected soon.
CVE-2026-125350 exp:2026-12-01
CVE-2026-87636 exp:2026-12-01
CVE-2026-9947 exp:2026-12-01

# --- certbot/certbot (latest digest already used) ---
